2026-07-27T10:08:16.5195038Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T10:08:16.5195769Z i /tmp/RtmpEYyD4f/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:08:16.5196257Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:08:16.5196837Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:08:16.5197784Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:08:16.5198601Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:08:16.5199836Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:08:16.5200998Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
